DESCRIPTION:Del-Mar-Va Council\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com/081-WFA\n
 \nCPR / AED / First Aid\, Wilderness First Aid\n\nECSI Wilderness First A
 id Course\nThe 2027 ECSI Wilderness First Aid Course is a two part course
  consisting of an 8-hour online section which must be completed prior to 
 the practical skills course. Both the online course and in-person practic
 al skills course must be completed in order to earn the WFA certificatio
 n. You will receive a completion card that will be valid for two years.\n
 Wilderness First Aid (WFA) is the assessment of and treatment given to a
 n ill or injured person in a remote environ
URL:https://global.scoutingevent.com/081-WFA
END:VEVENT
